      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "# accounts model defines the chart of accounts structure\n\n`powerhouse/accounts` (4 ops) is the simplest finance model. Defines account entities that [[account-transactions model tracks financial transaction records]] references for recording debits and credits.\n\n## Position in Ecosystem\n\nFoundation of the Finance & Billing zone \u2014 other finance models reference accounts.\n\n---\n\nTopics:\n- [[ecosystem map]]\n- [[object relations]]",
